{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02948","headline":"奉和人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制 · 宗楚客","name":"奉和人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窈窕神仙阁，参差云汉间。\n九重中叶啓，七日早春还。\n太液天爲水，蓬莱雪作山。\n今朝上林树，无处不堪攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗楚客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}